
PROFILE:

The strongest man in
the settlement.
Built the way he is,
he does two men's
work in the fields,
and in a fight he
has no equal - least
of all when Villa
needs defending.
A short temper and a
slow wit have earned
him a reputation as
a simple creature.
All the same, no one
else here has a
better chance of
holding his own out
in the Wastes.